WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:02.377
Hey, guys,
it's Lily Brooks O'Briant here.

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:06.006
And I am playing Ella McCaffrey
in the show Life by Ella.

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:09.009
My character
Ella went through cancer.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.469
Now that treatment's over,
she just wants to live life

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:12.303
to the fullest.

00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:14.514
Tackling fears and taking names.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.101
This show is honestly so amazing.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.978
The other actors and I
are super excited

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:22.147
to answer some questions
and have fun.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:22.647
Let's do it.

00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:23.565
I'm excited.

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:26.776
Hey, guys, what's up?

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:29.779
My name is Artyon Celestine,
 and I play Kai.

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:33.283
Today we're playing
two truths and a lie,

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:35.785
and you guys have to guess
which one is a lie.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:38.288
Number one,
I used to be a gymnast.

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:40.582
Number two, I have a bearded
dragon named Quincy.

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:43.334
And number three, I'm on
the varsity basketball team.

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:46.171
The lie is

00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:48.590
that I'm on the varsity
basketball team.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:52.719
I can't say I'm great at basketball,
but thanks for guessing 

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:55.096
that's true if you did.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.098
My name is Vanessa Carrasco.

00:00:57.098 --> 00:00:59.392
I play Ximena
on this amazing show.

00:01:00.101 --> 00:01:02.353
I've watched Jane
the Virgin over three times.

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:04.189
One of my cats names is Midnight,

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:06.900
and I've been in a movie
starring Christopher Walken.

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:09.986
The lie is that one of my cats
name is Midnight.

00:01:09.986 --> 00:01:11.529
His name is actually Shadow.

00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:12.614
Close enough.

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.199
Hi, my name is Aiden Wallace,

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:17.202
and I play Grady McCaffrey
on this show.

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:20.121
I am top 100 in Madden
NFL on Xbox.

00:01:20.371 --> 00:01:22.832
I hate the outdoors.

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:24.918
I love the Rams, the NFL team.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.545
The one that's a lie
is...

00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:29.172
that I hate the outdoors.

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:33.384
And I said I'm top 100 in MADDEN
All right, I'm like 92nd or something

00:01:33.384 --> 00:01:35.428
but I don't play it all the time.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.347
I go outside a fair amount.

00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:39.682
Hi, I'm Kevin.
Rahm and I play Carl the Dad.

00:01:39.849 --> 00:01:43.603
I have a charity golf tournament
to raise money for St Jude's

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.230
Children's Research Hospital.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:47.023
I played
this game with Eva Longoria.

00:01:48.316 --> 00:01:49.567
I had

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.694
lunch with the president
of the United States.

00:01:53.404 --> 00:01:56.741
I did not have lunch with the
president of the United States.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:57.659
No.

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.119
 Hi, I'm Mary Faber.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.663
I play Joanne
McCaffrey on the show.

00:02:01.746 --> 00:02:04.541
I've been in three Broadway
shows.

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:07.794
I have two kids.

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:11.464
I'm a descendant of royalty.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.842
The one that's not true is

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:18.721
I am not descended from royalty.

00:02:22.725 --> 00:02:24.644
(Excited screaming)

00:02:27.021 --> 00:02:28.481
Would you believe that

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.692
I have been to Disney World
12 times.

00:02:31.276 --> 00:02:34.112
I lived in New York City and

00:02:34.362 --> 00:02:38.158
my favorite food is caviar.

00:02:38.199 --> 00:02:39.033
Drum roll, please.

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:42.162
I actually hate caviar.

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:44.581
It was not good. It's
not good at all.

00:02:44.581 --> 00:02:46.958
It was really salty. I didn't like it,

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:47.834
but I tried it.

00:02:48.251 --> 00:02:49.669
And that's something
I've actually learned

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:50.795
from my character.

00:02:50.795 --> 00:02:53.840
Ella is going to try everything
and she knows that

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:54.632
if you're scared

00:02:54.632 --> 00:02:55.300
to do something,

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.093
you have to get over it
and just try it

00:02:57.093 --> 00:02:58.928
because you only have one chance
to live your life

00:02:58.928 --> 00:03:01.014
and you have to just
have fun and be yourself. 

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:03.516
Cannonball!

